WEBVTT

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:36.900
She's still alive in this condition?

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.320
Her Amatsuriki is steadily weakening.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:43.380
If we leave her like this, she will eventually...

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:47.310
But there is still that boy, Arata.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:50.830
To think that boy is Tsukuyo's Sho...

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:56.340
Tsukuyo, the sword of origins 
that will reign over the world.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:59.030
So it has awakened from its long sleep.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.120
Arata is heading for the capital.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:07.550
If she comes into contact with Tsukuyo,

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:09.600
the princess will be revived.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:14.610
But Tsukuyo will not be 
forced to submit so easily.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:18.100
Do not worry. I have taken steps.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:25.540
Orochi

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:36.720
You're not concentrating hard enough.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.510
And you're the one who said 
you wanted some practice.

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:44.720
Well, I just can't seem to relax.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:51.120
He's got his eyes on the Hayagami.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.550
Is your play sword fight over?

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:56.900
Then hurry up and prepare
 our meal. I'm starving.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:01.530
Kotoha is out looking for food right now.

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:04.910
If you're gonna travel with us, 
you should work, too!

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:08.990
I had no desire to
 travel with you people.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:13.150
Arata begged me to come along,
 so I really had no choice.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:14.420
I did not!

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:15.750
Hey!

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.830
Why did you invite that
 self-centered jerk along?

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.560
Yeah, I kind of regret it, too.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:23.740
I can hear you.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.010
Master Arata!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.260
Sorry for taking so long.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:28.880
Welcome back.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:31.710
Food's here, Lord Kannagi.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.700
Great. Bring it here.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:36.540
What? I told you, 
do some work yourself!

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:36.540
Look, I found lots of food.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.240
Thanks. Here, let me take it.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.840
Oh, that's all right...

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.280
I'll take it!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:42.950
Looks good!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.390
Hey! Kanate!

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:45.700
Here, Arata!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:46.780
That's Kannagi's.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.360
Take it to him on the double.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.410
Why me?!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.000
Because you invited him! 
Take responsibility!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.620
Huh? What the hell?

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.230
And now you're eating before us.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.640
Here, Kannagi.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.980
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:20.000
Hinohara!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:45.690
I'm home!

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:47.640
Welcome back.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.810
How was school today?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:55.270
Oh, well, nothing too 
special happened, I guess.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:57.070
I see...

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:59.630
Well, that's how it goes.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.550
I'm really in it here...

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:09.600
Onii-chan!

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:13.660
You should talk to Mom more.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:14.790
Huh?

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.970
Mom is worried about you.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.970
She waited all this time 
for you to come home.

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:23.380
Yeah, but it's not like I can help that.

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:26.380
Can't you at least call her "Mom"?

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.710
You haven't called her that all this time.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.020
What's wrong?

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:35.730
Uh... W-Well...

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.230
M—

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:38.900
M...?

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.170
M— M—

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:43.320
Muru for dinner, please!

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:52.260
I don't even have parents, 
especially a mom.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.680
I don't know how I'm 
supposed to connect with her.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.170
<i>So, who was the guy?</i>

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.420
<i>Oh, his name was Kadowaki.</i>

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.140
Maybe they really are friends?

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:14.770
There's way too much I don't know.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.240
You're...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:20.770
Hey!

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.900
Why is he running?

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.440
Yo!

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:29.950
There's something I want to ask you.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.120
Wh-What?

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:34.150
Well, how do I put it?

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:37.580
Are you my friend?

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:44.630
You... You heard me 
back then, didn't you?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.720
<i>Hinohara and I were never friends.</i>

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:52.270
Yeah, that's right. I'm scum.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.530
But what else was I supposed to do?

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:59.700
If I hadn't said that, they'd 
have made me their target, too!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.230
I couldn't stand that!

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:07.140
I did nothing wrong. Anyone would...

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:10.950
Even you would have done the same 
if you'd been in my place!

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.770
Even you would...

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.160
No...

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:20.840
I know you'd never do that. I was...

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.520
I was just weak.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:30.410
I'm sorry... I'm sorry!

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:32.580
Is that right?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.260
Well, can't help that.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.180
So I guess you really 
are my friend, huh?

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.300
A-Arata...

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:48.000
Does that mean Kadowaki
 is my friend, too?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.110
Hey...

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.780
Wh-What?

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:56.200
Do you know where Kadowaki is?

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:06.180
Masato, where are you
 going at this hour?

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.270
Nowhere.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.660
Hold it! What about cram school?

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.550
You were supposed to start
 once you entered high school.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.780
You don't attend any clubs, 
and you don't study.

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:15.890
You just wander around.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.300
Shut up.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.050
It was the same with middle school.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:23.690
You said you wanted to attend 
a school with a good track team

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.510
and refused to take the exam for 
the middle school I referred you to.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.070
Then you quit that team 
in your second year.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.520
I bet you just quit the moment 
you lost to someone!

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:35.790
You never win because 
you do everything so half-assed!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.320
Yet, the one thing you 
excel at is being rebellious.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.850
If you don't have the guts
 to see anything through,

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:43.870
then at least obey your father!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:49.530
And what about you?

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:52.450
You had a call earlier from a young woman.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.490
If you're gonna dump Mom, 
be slick about it,

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:57.850
like the corrupt city councilman you are!

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.970
Don't talk back to me, child!

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:06.140
This is exactly why your mother left you!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.770
Oh, it's raining.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.440
It just started out of nowhere.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.530
Kannagi?

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:18.080
Looks like we've entered 
Yorunami's domain.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:19.450
Yorunami?

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:23.740
One of the Twelve Shinsho,
 and the Sho of a water Hayagami.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.420
I've heard he can control the rain.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:31.250
So he knows we're in his domain?

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.060
It's just rain. It doesn't mean anything.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:37.430
At any rate, let's look for a place
 to get out of the rain.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:44.680
Hey, you said he was the Sho
 of a water Hayagami, right?

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:45.770
Yes.

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:49.440
Your Homura was a fire Hayagami,

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.680
Akachi's Okoro was an earth Hayagami...

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.660
And Yorunami's is water.

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.780
What about the other Shinsho?

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:59.990
What Hayagami do they have, 
and what kind of people are they?

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.660
Are you trying to obtain information 
in preparation for battle?

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.190
Don't get too dependent.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:08.670
Remember that I'm 
after your Hayagami, too.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:11.780
I know that all too well.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:16.540
The twelve of us never
 did anything together,

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:17.900
except at special ceremonies.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.090
Particularly the Six Sho.

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:21.680
The Six Sho?

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.260
They're strange men.

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:27.740
I've never seen any of their faces.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.940
They're probably not people 
you'd want to fight against.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:37.030
Really now...

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.260
You're in Lord Yorunami's domain,

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.530
and you're worried about the Six Sho?

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.640
You must really look down on us.

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:51.570
After he fled from the palace,

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:54.210
Arata the Sho strayed into the Kando Forest.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.660
Which means he's from another world?

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.430
It must be so.

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:03.720
But to think that he would 
end up using that Hayagami...

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:07.270
Yes. We must awaken <i>it</i>.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.560
To eliminate Arata the Sho,

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:13.530
as well as Tsukuyo.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.640
We're depending on you, Harunawa.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:18.650
Yes.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.100
Count on me.

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:29.870
Mom!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:32.370
Onii-chan is gone!

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:33.540
What?

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:40.620
Kadowaki is around here?

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.400
Yeah, he almost always is.

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:46.650
But, was it okay to come here 
without telling your family?

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:50.800
Well, I want to ask him what happened

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.600
between him and Hinohara.

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.900
Huh? Him and Hinohara?

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.860
Kadowaki sure is a downer lately.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.450
Yeah, he even lost to Hinohara. 
Talk about lame.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:11.860
But his dad is a rich 
city councilman, you know.

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:12.460
For real?

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:15.080
That's the one thing 
he's got going for him.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.650
We've gotta buddy up 
to him then, huh?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.820
I'm getting bored with Hinohara, though.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.390
Next time, let's go for...

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:24.580
H-Hey...

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:25.930
Huh? What is it?

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:29.930
Don't scare us! 
Speak up if you're there!

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:34.740
What's with that look?

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.000
Got a problem with us?

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.090
We were just saying

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.920
we should start playing 
with you instead of Hinohara.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:45.640
Yeah, show some gratitude.

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:48.910
Every damn one of you...

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.630
What? You wanna go now?

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.830
Think you can beat us alone?

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:58.710
What's this? You guys playing again?

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:00.860
Hinohara?

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:01.790
Arata...

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:05.470
But all of you against one is unfair.

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:09.720
Why don't I jump in to 
back up Kadowaki, then?

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.570
Th-This is no fun anymore.

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:15.270
Yeah. I'm bored.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.350
Let's go.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:20.320
Hey, you okay?

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:23.220
Who asked for your help?

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:26.000
What the hell is your deal?

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:29.660
Looking so damn calm all the time!

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:33.190
That attitude of yours 
makes me look like a fool!

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:34.200
Just like back then...

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.280
Huh? Back then?

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.580
You're always looking down at people.

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:48.340
You're an asshole!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.640
Aren't you making some kind of mistake?

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:52.990
Wh—

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.660
I don't think Hinohara 
is that kind of guy.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:57.290
What'd you say?

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.650
Have you ever tried talking to him?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.620
To "him"? I'm talking to you now!

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:03.690
Are you making fun of me?!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.210
I'm not making fun of you!

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:10.180
See, actually, I'm not Hinohara—

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.270
Arata!

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.430
What are you doing?

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.590
Nao and I looked everywhere for you!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:33.780
As if it's not enough your 
memory is compromised...

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.730
Do you know how worried I was?

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:41.890
U-Uh...

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:44.670
I'm so glad you're all right.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.650
I-I'm sorry, la—

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.820
...Mom.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:52.040
H-Hey!

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:07.720
<i>Don't talk back to me, child!</i>

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.900
<i>This is exactly why your mother left you!</i>

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:25.140
<i>But his dad is a rich
 city councilman, you know.</i>

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:28.210
<i>That's the one thing 
he's got going for him.</i>

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:29.900
Damn it!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.940
They're all making fun of me!

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.410
Every damn one of them!

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:38.580
Every damn one of them...

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:56.240
That bastard... Hinohara...

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.560
It's his fault.

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:02.650
He took my place away from me!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.360
Sacred forest...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:12.350
If not for him, right now I'd be...

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:15.780
It's all his fault!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:21.200
Ye hate-filled soul, open now
 the door to the other world.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.960
I'll kill him. I'll kill him.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.510
I'll kill him. I'll kill him!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:37.510
I'll kill you, Hinohara!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:41.480
And guide me there.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.530
Wh-What is this place?

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.370
What's going on?

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.040
Appear.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.080
Hinohara...

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.960
So that's it.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.560
I thought something wasn't right.

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.890
So he was deceiving me.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.600
That Hinohara was a fake.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:44.330
The real one

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.320
is in this world, isn't he?!

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:53.420
Success.

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:55.320
Where is he?

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.890
Where is Hinohara?!

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:17.620
Arata acquired a Hayagami 
called Tsukuyo and became a Sho.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:21.910
He intends to become
 the king of Amawakuni.

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.960
Him, a king?

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.120
He's making fools of you.

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:28.610
In that case...

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:31.180
Become a Sho yourself.

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:33.800
Sho?

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:37.290
Become one of us, 
the Twelve Shinsho,

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.390
and defeat Arata yourself.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:43.210
Me? Defeat Hinohara?

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:47.000
The one to make Arata submit 
must be one who despises him,

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:50.560
one who bears powerful
 hatred against him.

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:55.770
It is those feelings that
 brought you to this world.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.310
Only you can do it.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.270
You are the chosen one.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:05.700
Chosen one?

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:12.570
I don't really get what 
you guys are talking about,

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.240
but basically...

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:18.270
You're telling me to wipe out 
that bastard Hinohara, right?

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.060
There is a sword that 
suits you perfectly.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.170
A sword?

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.820
You can only defeat Arata 
if you pair with a Hayagami.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.640
However,

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:34.990
whether or not the sword
 chooses you is up to you.

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.530
This is a Hayagami?

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:13.230
Indeed. It is the only Hayagami 
that can defeat Tsukuyo and Arata.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:17.450
Like Tsukuyo, it has been asleep 
for a very long time,

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:22.010
kept sealed by generation after 
generation of Hime Clan members:

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.240
Orochi.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:25.980
Orochi...

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:42.820
Master Arata?

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.760
I-It's nothing...

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.540
<i>What was that?</i>

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.100
They intend to awaken Orochi?

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:58.520
What will you do, Kannagi?

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.990
Very interesting...

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:05.610
However, I will be the one
 to make Arata the Sho submit.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.440
That is my destiny.

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:17.160
Orochi is responding...

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.020
No. It hasn't begun yet.

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:22.490
Will he become Orochi's Sho,

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:26.610
or will he be swallowed like
 all the others who have tried?

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.640
Hayagami... Orochi!

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:34.090
Become mine!

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:35.590
So I can

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:37.860
crush Hinohara!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:41.790
Show me...

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:47.450
Show me your hatred!

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:51.600
Come to me, Orochi!

00:21:55.990 --> 00:21:58.960
Well done, Kadowaki the Sho.

00:23:40.490 --> 00:23:41.870
Kadowaki...

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:44.320
Why are you in this world?!

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:46.570
Kill him, Orochi!

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:51.160
You're not him. You're really not him.

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:54.520
Demonization

00:23:51.160 --> 00:23:53.090
Who are you?
